	(text "NO capacitor on RES: it must track VCC for internal POR.\nExternal reset drivers must be open-drain/open-collector.\nHold RESET low >= 3 ms, then release after VCC is valid.\nHold BOOT during external reset release for SCI/USBFS mode.\nNormal MD high; SWD/JTAG boot requests occur during RES low.\nDevice lifecycle / authentication restrictions still apply."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 223.52 0)
		(effects
