	)
	(text "References: RA8P1 HUM Rev.1.30 sections 2.5, 4.3-4.4, 21.4.\nQuick Design Guide R01AN7883EU0110 sections 2 and 6.\nReset timing: RA8P1 Datasheet Rev.1.30 Table 2.52 p.118.\nSwitch, header and resistor orderable part selections remain open."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
